ered. Navigating to /category/does-not-exist shows a clear 'Category Not Found' heading with explanatory text, no unrelated product grid or stale category data rendered.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Changing search text, category dropdown, sort dropdown, min-rating dropdown, and tag chips all updated products.grid and products.count immediately without any page navigation/reload (verified via semantic_snapshot without url re-navigation).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicked the image link of \\\"Bowflex SelectTech 552\\\" card on /products (distinct from name link) and it navigated to /product/bowflex-selecttech-552, the correct matching detail page.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Buy Now links on product cards have target=\\\"_blank\\\" and href pointing to external domains (e.g. https://example.com/bowflex, https://example.com/peloton, https://example-retailer.com/qa-speaker).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-21\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Category filter dropdown on category pages does not change selection\", \"actual\": \"On /category/tech, the category filter dropdown is available and shows \\\"Tech Gadgets\\\". Selecting \\\"Fitness\\\" or \\\"All Categories\\\" from the dropdown does not change the dropdown's displayed value (remains \\\"Tech Gadgets\\\") and does not update the displayed products (still shows only the 3 tech products). The dropdown is effectively locked to the page's URL category. Note: switching category via the top navigation links (Tech/Home/Fitness) does work correctly and updates the products, but the category-filter control itself (the one offered directly on the category page, matching the checklist wording) is non-functional.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"a